          "promptEn": "**Characters & Action:** Ren and Nei walk through the crowded, neon-soaked streets of Kamata at night. Nei looks up at Ren, talking animatedly. They have seamlessly slipped back into their own world. **Emotion:** An easy, comfortable companionship. **Clothing:** Ren is in his hoodie. Nei wears her distinctive sailor-style outfit. **Camera Angle:** A long, tracking shot following the pair as they navigate the bustling street. **Background:** The vibrant, chaotic, and slightly grimy streets of Kamata, with neon signs reflecting in puddles on the pavement."
        },
        {
