        },
        {
          "@id": "gh:panelPrompt/p17-4",
          "panelIndex": 4,
          "promptEn": "**Text & Emotion:** A simple, stark title card. The text 'Ghost Hacker - Episode 1 End' appears in a clean, white, sans-serif font. **Emotion:** A quiet, lingering sense of mystery and anticipation. **Camera Angle:** N/A. Full-screen text. **Background:** Solid black."
