      ],
      "promptEn": "As he leaves the office, Ren gives a slight wave with one hand without looking back. His back view conveys a sense of reliability without needing words. Ren and Nei walk through the evening crowd of Kamata. Nei is looking up at Ren and talking. The two have returned to their daily life. Close-up of Ren looking at his smartphone, confirming a payment, and smirking. It shows his (financial) side as a hacker. The text 'Ghost Hacker - Episode 1 End' is displayed in white on a black background, leaving a quiet afterglow. Character details: Ren's slim back is framed by his ever-present dark gray hoodie and dark jeans as he lifts one hand in a lazy, confident wave, his messy short dark hair slightly tousled; in the Kamata street scene he walks with hands in his pockets, pale face relaxed as neon lights reflect off his dark sneakers; Nei keeps pace beside him in her white sailor-collar blouse, navy pleated skirt, white knee-high socks and black Mary Jane shoes, her neat shoulder-length black hair and bright, expressive eyes turned up toward him as she talks; in the close-up, Ren's half-open eyes narrow in a sly smirk as the glow of his smartphone screen lights his features, emphasizing the cool, understated money side of this ghost hacker.",
